        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DHK4, Solid Brass 4 Inch Kickdown Door Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4 Inch Kickdown Door Stop mounts to the lower surface of the door to keep it in an open position. When not in use, it flips up and out of the way. This kickdown door holder is made of solid brass by Deltana, It includes a non-skid easily replaceable rubber tip to protect the floor and is supplied with mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DHK4-specifications.gif?v=1704354727\" width\"328\" height=\"329\" border=\"0\" atl=\"4\" Kickdown Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<a href=\"/products/5-inch-kickdown-door-stop-deltana-dhk5\"><b>5 Inch Kickdown</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/extra-long-7-inch-kickdown-door-stop-deltana-dhk7\"><b>7 Inch Long Kickdown</b></a>  and  <a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-kickdown-door-holder-deltana-del-dhk-rubber\"><b>Replacement Rubber Tips</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana DHK4 Door Mounted Kickdown Doorstopper:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Arm Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Arm Thickness: 3/8\" x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>rubber Tip Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Plate Overall Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Plate Center to Center Height: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Plate Overall Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Plate Center to Center Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Tip: Gray</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DHK4.pdf?v=1704262155\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DHK4 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4 Inch Kickdown Door Stop",
                "description": "Solid Brass 4 Inch Kickdown Door Holder, Deltana DHK4 - The 4 Inch Kickdown Door Stop mounts to the lower surface of the door to keep it in an open position. When not in use, it flips up and out of the way. This kickdown door holder is made of solid brass by Deltana, It includes a non-skid easily replaceable rubber tip to protect the floor and is supplied with mounting screws. Available in 9 great finishes.",
